From 7eadb6f8c283aace11e8e6590d598c3c0c360938 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Damiano Lampisti <35961105+damianolampisti00@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 28 Oct 2026 20:43:04 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 1/5] Add TARGET=bb10 (BlackBerry 10 / QNX 8, GCC 9.3)

- Makefile.defs: bb10 target (arm-blackberry-qnx8eabi, Cortex-A9 softfp),
  CMAKE_SYSTEM_NAME QNX, meson system qnx, compat headers, _NO_CPP_INLINES.
- Exclude czmq/libzmq, sdcv/glib, tar; ship libgcc_s.so.1 with libstdc++.
- QNX fixes: luajit (TARGET_SYS=QNX), libressl (getentropy/arc4random),
  djvulibre (getc macro), k2pdfopt (stricmp, min/max, off64_t), mupdf
  (stdint), luasocket (UNIX), nnsvg (strndup shim).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
